<title>SINGAPORE: Taiwan's BSPA to tender for 54,000T soybeans.</title>
<headline>Taiwan's BSPA to tender for 54,000T soybeans.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Breakfast Soybean Procurement Association will tender on Tuesday for a 54,000-tonne shipment of Brazilian or Argentine soybeans, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>The shipment is slated for delivery from a South American port between August 21 to September 10, traders said.</p>
